sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Client
  participant D as Daemon
  participant P as Planner
  participant I as Implementer
  participant T as Tester
  participant R as Reviewer

  U->>C: agentmux task run "..."
  C->>D: task.run
  D->>D: create task/team/worktrees
  D->>P: spawn claude PTY
  D->>I: spawn codex/claude PTY
  D->>T: spawn shell PTY
  D->>R: spawn reviewer PTY
  D->>P: paste planner prompt
  P-->>D: AGENTMUX_RESULT plan
  D->>D: parse result / create messages
  D->>I: inject TaskAssignment
  I-->>D: AGENTMUX_RESULT implementation
  D->>D: capture diff artifact
  D->>T: inject TestRequest
  T-->>D: AGENTMUX_RESULT test result
  D->>D: create TestResult context
  D->>R: inject ReviewRequest with diff/test paths
  R-->>D: AGENTMUX_RESULT review
  D-->>C: final summary event
  C-->>U: show recommendation
